    {
      "name": "login.send",
      "description": "Worker-only code delivery for the currently registered private trusted input. Serialized per UID; root-only SQLite loginDeliveryStatePath persists unknown in a FULL synchronous commit before control/Telegram write and stores only requestId/outcome. Replay, timeout, cancellation, crash, close/reopen or restart never re-send the same recorded input. New real input uses a new stable requestId and Auth invalidates the prior code. Late completion cannot suppress a newer input. maxLoginReceipts defaults to 1000000; capacity blocks new login attempts without evicting old receipts or blocking ordinary input admission. No code or user text is stored or returned.",
